ws":29321,"scoreCompleteness":66,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792382400000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration","licenseConstraintId":"custom"},{"id":"549e943ffb5147238c91070f1fb7ac95","owner":"EIA.gov","created":1685712249000,"modified":1691680384000,"guid":"C354E12A-8F89-4EE8-8947-5C815ED3E2CD","name":"Geographies_wRECSData.sd","title":"Geographies_wRECSData","type":"Service Definition","typeKeywords":[".sd","ArcGIS","Metadata","Online","Service Definition"],"description":"<p><span>U.S. Census Bureau geometry of the 50 states plus Washington D.C., and the same geometry dissolved to create unified United States geometry.  Each feature is joined 1:M to the Energy Information Administration's (EIA) Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS) data, and then output such that each record has its own geometry. <\/span><\/p>\n<p>We periodically conduct the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS)<\/i><\/a>, which provides detailed estimates of energy usage in U.S. homes. This dashboard includes selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics information from the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>2020 RECS<\/i><\/a>, the 15<sup>th<\/sup> iteration of the survey.<\/p>\n<p>You can find additional information about the <i>2020 RECS<\/i>, including <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/terminology.cfm' rel='nofollow ugc'>terminology<\/a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=methodology' rel='nofollow ugc'>methodology<\/a>,\n<a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=microdata' rel='nofollow ugc'>microdata\nfile<\/a><span>,<\/span> and <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state' rel='nofollow ugc'>data\ntables<\/a>, on our website.<\/p>\n<p>Estimates and relative standard error values are available in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'>state data tables<\/a>. Perceived differences between the estimates displayed in the bar chart may not be statistically significant.<\/p>\n<p>Notes: Some estimates are not available for all states (<i>Data withheld<\/i>) because either the relative\nstandard error (RSE) was greater than 50% or there were fewer than 10 households in the reporting sample. These are identified as \u201cQ\u201d or \u201cN\u201d in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>RECS<\/i>\ndata tables<\/a>. Exercise caution when deriving withheld estimates from published estimates.<\/p>\n<p>Data source: U.S. Energy Information Administration, Office of Energy Demand and Integrated Statistics, <i>2020\nResidential Energy Consumption Survey<\/i><\/p>","tags":["Residential Energy Consumption Survey","household energy","square footage","site consumption","space heating","air conditioning","refrigerators","water heating","all-electric","natural gas","electricity","propane","fuel oil"],"snippet":"Service definition for RECS Data.  These data include selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures and household characteristics information from the 2020 Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS).","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-179.148924266415,-14.5486920218588],[179.778454743967,71.365161739487]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"WGS_1984_Web_Mercator_Auxiliary_Sphere","accessInformation":"U.S. Energy Information Administration","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":59,"scoreCompleteness":83,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792123200000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"8dfec258438441b68c9c4e1c41589f2f","owner":"EIA.gov","created":1688152964000,"modified":1782762508000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"RECS Desktop","type":"Dashboard","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Dashboards","Dashboard","Operations Dashboard"],"description":"<p>We periodically conduct the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS)<\/i><\/a>, which provides detailed estimates of energy usage in U.S. homes. This dashboard includes selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics information from the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>2020 RECS<\/i><\/a>, the 15<sup>th<\/sup> iteration of the survey.<\/p>\n<p>You can find additional information about the <i>2020 RECS<\/i>, including <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/terminology.cfm' rel='nofollow ugc'>terminology<\/a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=methodology' rel='nofollow ugc'>methodology<\/a>,\n<a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=microdata' rel='nofollow ugc'>microdata\nfile<\/a><span>,<\/span> and <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state' rel='nofollow ugc'>data\ntables<\/a>, on our website.<\/p>\n<p>Estimates and relative standard error values are available in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'>state data tables<\/a>. Perceived differences between the estimates displayed in the bar chart may not be statistically significant.<\/p>\n<p>Notes: Some estimates are not available for all states (<i>Data withheld<\/i>) because either the relative\nstandard error (RSE) was greater than 50% or there were fewer than 10 households in the reporting sample. These are identified as \u201cQ\u201d or \u201cN\u201d in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>RECS<\/i>\ndata tables<\/a>. Exercise caution when deriving withheld estimates from published estimates.<\/p>\n<p>Data source: U.S. Energy Information Administration, Office of Energy Demand and Integrated Statistics, <i>2020\nResidential Energy Consumption Survey<\/i><\/p>","tags":[""],"snippet":"Desktop configuration for RECS Dashboard.  These data include selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures and household characteristics information from the 2020 Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS).","thumbnail":"thumbnail/ago_downloaded.png","documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":["/Categories/Public Content"],"spatialReference":"","accessInformation":"U.S. Energy Information Administration","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":66978,"scoreCompleteness":66,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792386000000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"8ec5cde5c0574125be397cbc973f27d0","owner":"EIA.gov","created":1643894884000,"modified":1652888617000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"ShalePlay_Midland_Spraberry_Lower_Isopach_EIA_202111","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"descri